00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:31.830
- I ruined her own name for her.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:33.060
- And another guy was
there and I was like,

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:34.820
he was listening, I was like yeah,

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.160
when Rhett heard that
her name was Blandine

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:40.130
he made me feel weird about saying it.

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:41.570
Oh, Blandine.

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:43.650
- It's just, it's
literally my favorite name

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:45.120
