00:55:11.470 --> 00:55:13.170
we're hoping to capture something.

00:55:13.170 --> 00:55:14.003
- Mm-hmm.
- Right,

00:55:14.003 --> 00:55:17.640
and that's a good, that's
the best that we have both

00:55:17.640 --> 00:55:20.730
