- And go with this bit

00:57:51.700 --> 00:57:53.220
and continue to carry it out whereas,

00:57:53.220 --> 00:57:55.000
I don't have that in me.

00:57:55.000 --> 00:57:57.060
- So for the record I did not do that.

00:57:57.060 --> 00:57:58.360
- Right, you, we got you.

00:57:58.360 --> 00:57:59.570
We really got you.
- You got me.

00:57:59.570 --> 00:58:00.700
- And that's when it's funniest.

00:58:00.700 --> 00:58:01.720
- I still haven't watched that one back.

00:58:01.720 --> 00:58:02.900
I would watch that one back.

