00:58:05.120 --> 00:58:07.860
when you have to do it intentionally.

00:58:07.860 --> 00:58:10.930
It's funnier when you're being authentic.

00:58:10.930 --> 00:58:13.040
- And that would be a
hard thing to do anyway,

00:58:13.040 --> 00:58:17.190
but you know, I do feel like people--

00:58:17.190 --> 00:58:19.300
- But you know what--
- People feel sorry for me

00:58:19.300 --> 00:58:22.070
and that's the thing that
I do want to address.

00:58:22.070 --> 00:58:25.190
- Well but before we get
to that because I do think,

00:58:25.190 --> 00:58:27.363
to play into the question,

00:58:30.530 --> 00:58:33.723
I knew that it would be funny
