00:58:34.640 --> 00:58:37.890
but if there wasn't a camera there

00:58:38.781 --> 00:58:40.631
and I was just like, I'm gonna prank,

00:58:41.830 --> 00:58:44.380
I do not, we don't prank each other.

00:58:44.380 --> 00:58:46.880
Again, this is a little
bit what's on screen

00:58:46.880 --> 00:58:48.682
