to engineer something,

00:59:12.410 --> 00:59:15.970
well, you can bet that
it's going to be online.

00:59:15.970 --> 00:59:18.990
But it's also just like,
that's not our personalities.

00:59:18.990 --> 00:59:21.466
It's not our personalities
to find some way

00:59:21.466 --> 00:59:24.210
to mess with each other like that.

00:59:24.210 --> 00:59:27.300
And also, if I were to do that,

00:59:27.300 --> 00:59:28.550
if I were to, for some reason to decide

00:59:28.550 --> 00:59:32.340
that I was gonna prank you,
your reaction to a prank

00:59:32.340 --> 00:59:36.270
that wasn't being filmed would
be like 10% as entertaining

00:59:36.270 --> 00:59:37.630
as your reaction to a prank

00:59:38.510 --> 00:59:40.497
if you were being filmed and you knew it.

00:59:40.497 --> 00:59:42.950
And it isn't because you're acting,

00:59:42.950 --> 00:59:46.060
it's just that when you're
on and when the camera's on--

00:59:46.060 --> 00:59:47.650
- I just don't have that much energy.

00:59:47.650 --> 00:59:52.110
- You're in a mode where
you're like, I'm reacting,

00:59:52.110 --> 00:59:53.970
I'm processing things out loud

00:59:53.970 --> 00:59:57.350
and that is a recipe for entertainment.

00:59:57.350 --> 00:59:58.420
- And you know what--
- Whereas,

00:59:58.420 --> 01:00:00.640
if you're just by yourself, you're just,

01:00:00.640 --> 01:00:03.394
