01:00:20.161 --> 01:00:20.994
I got you!

01:00:22.770 --> 01:00:26.570
I've had a camera in our
office for like two years.

01:00:26.570 --> 01:00:28.600
- You can release that,
it'd be very boring.

01:00:28.600 --> 01:00:30.200
- And it's so boring.

01:00:30.200 --> 01:00:31.533
I got you, man.

01:00:33.730 --> 01:00:35.513
You know, the thing is,

01:00:37.240 --> 01:00:40.720
I feel like I've been, I don't know,

01:00:40.720 --> 01:00:42.470
I've been thinking more about this.

01:00:43.890 --> 01:00:46.370
It's funny, you do 1500 episodes of a show

01:00:46.370 --> 01:00:48.610
