Like in Fuquay when we first
started doing Chia Lincoln,

01:01:00.890 --> 01:01:04.940
like we'd be telling stories
and we wouldn't like,

01:01:04.940 --> 01:01:06.660
I wouldn't like a way
that you said something

01:01:06.660 --> 01:01:08.260
